# Animation

See `docs/ANIMATION-SPEC.md`.

- Easing: `[0.22, 1, 0.36, 1]`
- Entrance: 0.4–0.7s; hover: 0.15–0.25s
- Max 2–3 animated properties per element
- Always provide `prefers-reduced-motion` fallback
- Use shared ui: AnimatedText, RevealOnScroll, MagneticButton, Marquee
- Opening demos: `components/animations/OpeningTypeDemo.tsx`
